  "season_fiveDay": "Five Day",
  "season_fiveDay_items": "Fives",
  "skill_power_info": "A hit pays a fixed number of Ticks: PERFECT 6, GREAT 3, GOOD 1. Each level adds 150% of that (PERFECT: 6 → 15 → 24…).",
  "skill_fastForward_info": "Each level moves the stopwatch's start by about 0.13 s, up to 2.00 s at the top level. The stopwatch runs at normal speed and the target is still 5.00.",
  "skill_ticking_info": "From 4.00 to 5.00 you hear a tick every 0.1 s (with vibration if it's on).",
  "skill_wideEye_info": "The GREAT (±30 ms) and GOOD (±50 ms) windows grow by about 5% a level, up to ×1.8 at the top level (±54 and ±90 ms). Works on clocks too.",
  "skill_combo_info": "A PERFECT raises the multiplier by 0.05, an exact 5.00 straight to the cap. GREAT and GOOD leave it alone, a miss resets it. Without upgrades the cap is ×1.25; each level raises it by 0.10. It multiplies the whole payout for a hit, 5.00 and Echo included.",
  "skill_magnet_info": "The PERFECT window (±15 ms) grows by about 0.7 ms a level, up to ±25 ms. The 5.00 window (±10 ms) stays. Works on clocks too.",
  "skill_echo_info": "A hit adds as many Ticks as your clocks make in the given time. Per level: PERFECT 0.2 s, GREAT about 0.11 s, GOOD about 0.03 s.",
  "skill_bulletTime_info": "The PERFECT, GREAT, GOOD and CLOSE windows grow up to ×2.5 at the top level (e.g. GOOD: ±50 → ±125 ms). The 5.00 window stays. Near the target the screen pulses and you hear a heartbeat. Doesn't work on clocks.",
  "skill_luck_info": "At each level 2 hits in 100 jump a tier: GREAT → PERFECT, GOOD → GREAT. A PERFECT never becomes a 5.00.",
  "skill_shield_info": "Each level is one charge. A miss uses a charge and the multiplier stays. Used charges come back one per 10 hits; using a charge restarts that count.",
  "skill_goldenTouch_info": "A Golden Second appears every 10 minutes on average. Each level cuts that by 30 s and makes its effects (Frenzy, Lucky, Hot hand) 5% stronger.",
