  "help_springs": "Mainsprings work from your first rewind (the spiral at the top).\n• They wind themselves: one a day, even while you're away. At most 10 fit.\n• A hit on exactly 5.00 winds 15 minutes from the reserve. The reserve holds 2 hours and refills in 4 hours.\n• The first exactly-5.00 after an hour's break winds a whole hour.\nMainsprings pay for clock mastery: tier 1 costs 1 Mainspring, tier 2 costs 2, and so on up to tier 5. Each tier multiplies that clock's income ×1.5 for good — also after a rewind and in a new loop. Tiers 3 and 5 give a master's title.",
  "help_dials_t": "Dial faces",
  "help_dials": "Dial faces change only how the stopwatch looks, not your results. You earn them on several tracks at once: Ticks in the first days, clock mastery, Time Loops, a feat for the patient, and days in the game. Pick one with the dial button at the top of the screen.",
