  "adBlockedRule": "loop rule",
  "statLoop": "Time Loop",
  "help_loop_t": "Time Loop and the Chronicle",
  "help_loop": "Buying Chronos finishes the Time Loop: it opens a chapter of the story and lets you start a new loop.\n• A new loop resets everything, Chronons and perks included.\n• Mainsprings, clock mastery, achievements and dial faces stay.\n• In each loop Chronos changes one rule. Finishing such a loop earns a seal: a small permanent bonus and a dial face.\n• Each Chronos bonus earned before you leave the loop gives +1 Mainspring.\nSeven loops tell the whole story; after that you pick the rules. The Chronicle on the paradox screen keeps it all.",
  "rule_blindfold": "Broken Stopwatch",
  "rule_blindfold_desc": "Blind mode is always on: the digits vanish about a second before the target. It pays as usual.",
  "rule_blindfold_quote": "“Want to be on time? Learn to feel time. No digits.”",
  "seal_blindfold": "A Feel for It",
  "seal_blindfold_desc": "Blind mode pays one more (×4, ×5 with Daredevil).",
