  "seal_noGold_desc": "Back after an hour or more: a Golden Second flies in within 30 seconds.",
  "rule_shortFuse": "Short Fuse",
  "rule_shortFuse_desc": "The multiplier can climb 0.50 higher than usual, but anything short of a PERFECT resets it. No Shield.",
