  "help_challenges": "Every day three challenges, every week one more — the target shows on the badge at the top. Their numbers come from your own last taps, so they are a stretch whatever your aim, and a few minutes of play usually does it.\n• Each daily one pays 10 minutes of your clocks' income, all three together another 30.\n• The weekly one pays 1 Mainspring (before the first paradox: an hour of income).\n• Don't like one? ↻ swaps a daily challenge, once a day.\n• Finished but not claimed? It is paid when the new ones come — nothing is lost.",
